      "title": "Zeichensetzung und Großschreibung",
      "icon": "✍️",
      "teaching": [
        {
          "h": "All nouns are capitalized",
          "p": "Unlike English, this applies to every noun, everywhere in the sentence.",
          "ex": "Der Hund spielt mit dem Ball.",
          "audioId": "unit14-ex1"
        },
        {
          "h": "Comma before dass/weil/wenn",
          "p": "A comma is required before subordinate clauses.",
          "ex": "Ich weiß, dass du müde bist.",
          "audioId": "unit14-ex2"
        },
        {
          "h": "Comma in Satzreihen",
          "p": "Usually required between independent clauses joined by aber, denn, sondern.",
          "ex": "Ich wollte kommen, aber ich war krank.",
          "audioId": "unit14-ex3"
        },
        {
          "h": "Formal Sie is often capitalized mid-sentence",
          "p": "The formal \"you\" (Sie/Ihnen/Ihr) is capitalized wherever it appears.",
          "ex": "Wie geht es Ihnen?",
          "audioId": "unit14-ex4"
        }
      ],
      "quiz": [
